00:31:24,920 --> 00:31:26,720
pursued the change of the assumptions.

305
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:29,680
And then there's more papers, hundreds of citations.

306
00:31:29,680 --> 00:31:32,480
Yeah, yeah, but is the model true?

