00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:43,240
using this assumption, the world is so big

311
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:45,560
that no one individual makes a difference,

312
00:31:45,560 --> 00:31:48,280
you are doing what we call general equilibrium analysis,

313
00:31:48,280 --> 00:31:50,880
or GE for short.

314
00:31:50,880 --> 00:31:53,520
All right, questions?

315
00:31:53,520 --> 00:31:55,160
This is the idea.

