00:33:11,360 --> 00:33:13,040
OK, so here's a simple example.

347
00:33:13,040 --> 00:33:14,560
So suppose that we've got an economy.

348
00:33:14,560 --> 00:33:16,600
We've got high consumers with identical preferences

349
00:33:16,600 --> 00:33:18,640
of A. So this is a really boring economy.

350
00:33:18,640 --> 00:33:19,560
Two goods.

351
00:33:19,560 --> 00:33:21,480
Everybody's got identical preferences of down.

