00:48:45,320 --> 00:48:48,000
that everyone can access.

215
00:48:48,000 --> 00:48:50,760
And this is going to be equal to what?

216
00:48:50,760 --> 00:48:56,240
So it's going to be equal to summation of ai, yi bar,

217
00:48:56,240 --> 00:48:58,920
over summation of bi.

218
00:48:58,920 --> 00:49:02,320
And we have bi, xi, bar.

219
00:49:02,320 --> 00:49:03,880
How do I get the b come back?

220
00:49:03,880 --> 00:49:06,880
Well, I'll be back.

221
00:49:06,880 --> 00:49:08,720
It's easier to do the math without it,

