238
00:49:47,340 --> 00:49:48,800
But isn't the whole basis of this

239
00:49:48,800 --> 00:49:51,280
that no individual does change the price?

240
00:49:51,280 --> 00:49:56,240
Yeah, there is actually a little contradiction here,

241
00:49:56,240 --> 00:49:59,880
because essentially what this means

242
00:49:59,880 --> 00:50:02,920
is that in reality, as long as these

243
00:50:02,920 --> 00:50:05,680
are individuals of finite size, they actually

244
00:50:05,680 --> 00:50:07,280
