245
00:50:07,280 --> 00:50:09,640
And yet we've reasoned all the way through assuming

246
00:50:09,640 --> 00:50:10,680
there is wrong about it.

247
00:50:10,680 --> 00:50:12,800
So one way you can salvage this is say, yeah, well,

