00:50:34,680 --> 00:50:38,120
with a measure of one.

257
00:50:38,120 --> 00:50:41,520
And then each of them is an infinitesimal.

258
00:50:41,520 --> 00:50:44,240
Every one individual is an infinitesimal amount.

