441
00:58:18,040 --> 00:58:20,800
So now we can have k commodities where k is any number,

442
00:58:20,800 --> 00:58:22,680
any number you want.

443
00:58:22,680 --> 00:58:25,040
And then we need to add on a few other assumptions

444
00:58:25,040 --> 00:58:26,800
