453
00:58:41,120 --> 00:58:42,080
All right, good.

454
00:58:42,080 --> 00:58:42,580
All right.

455
00:58:42,580 --> 00:58:43,920
So then that's OK.

456
00:58:43,920 --> 00:58:45,040
All right, next assumption.

457
00:58:45,040 --> 00:58:48,320
So assume that utility of x is strictly

