01:01:28,140 --> 01:01:30,300
maximize utility subject to the constraint

36
01:01:30,300 --> 01:01:33,500
that the price vector times the consumption vector

37
01:01:33,500 --> 01:01:35,460
is less than or equal to the price vector times

