123
01:05:28,020 --> 01:05:28,740
All right.

124
01:05:28,740 --> 01:05:30,580
Now, this is all I got to say.

125
01:05:30,580 --> 01:05:32,280
So I will be first to admit this is not

126
01:05:32,280 --> 01:05:34,020
the most exciting part of economics.

127
01:05:34,020 --> 01:05:36,700
But there is a useful intuition here.

128
01:05:36,700 --> 01:05:38,780
And the useful intuition is this.

129
01:05:38,780 --> 01:05:42,060
We've got a world where we assume that, first of all,

130
01:05:42,060 --> 01:05:43,460
endowments are fixed.

131
01:05:43,460 --> 01:05:44,500
So there's no production.

