01:05:46,220 --> 01:05:48,140
Nothing anybody can do about that.

134
01:05:48,140 --> 01:05:51,020
And then also, preferences are fixed.

135
01:05:51,020 --> 01:05:53,860
This isn't general psychological theory.

136
01:05:53,860 --> 01:05:55,940
This is general equilibrium theory.

137
01:05:55,940 --> 01:05:59,020
And so these preferences, the weights

138
01:05:59,020 --> 01:06:01,460
that people put on each good, those are going to be fixed,

